  aciklama:
  - "Seni iki dev a\u011Fac\u0131n aras\u0131nda g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}. A\u011Fa\xE7lar\u0131n
    birinden inen sincap, h\u0131zl\u0131 ad\u0131mlarla senin \xF6n\xFCnden ge\xE7erek
    di\u011Fer a\u011Faca \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor. \xC7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131 a\u011Fac\u0131n
    \xFCzerinde ise oyma \u015Feklinde {{sabit_sayi,10,27}} say\u0131s\u0131 var.
    Gelecek ay, takvimde {{sabit_sayi,10,27}} say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    g\xFCn b\xFCy\xFCk bir k\u0131smet aya\u011F\u0131na gelecek. Bir telefon alacak
    ve bir teklifle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Facaks\u0131n. Memnuniyetle kabul edece\u011Fini
    ve sevincini en k\u0131sa zamanda en yak\u0131nlar\u0131ndaki insanlarla payla\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorum."
